There is a 3-bed/2-bath front unit of a house with its own kitchen and laundry available right away.
Features include:
- Top Temple City School District: 9/10 Temple City High School;
- Close to transportations or stores/restaurants: I-10, I-210;
- Spacious bedroom and closets, 2 suites with their own bathrooms;
- All Bedrooms are furnished with beds or desks;
- Newly finished laminate floor and wall painting;
- Within-unit washer/dryer hook-up (washer/dryer on tenants) ;
- Central HVAC and forced air heating;
- Large back yard full of fruit trees to share with other 2 units;
- Kitchen with stove and refrigerator, and adequate cabinets;
- Adequate parking space: 2 in front, 2 in detached garage, and 3 in backyard;
- Rent: $3200 for up to 5 people; $3300 for up to 6 people);
- Utilities: on tenants (about $100-200 per month).
Prerequisite:
- Credit score of 700 or above
For serious inquiries only, text 614-five99-3.Seven.6.Nine

