There are Temple City School district 5-bedroom/4-bathroom house for 1+ year rental, including a 3-bed/2-bath front unit and a 2-bed/2-bath attached unit, each with its own kitchen and laundry (washer/dryer on tenants).
Features include:
- Top Temple City School District: 9/10 Temple City High School;
- Close to transportations or stores/restaurants: I-10, I-210;
- Spacious bedroom and closets, 3 suites with their own bathrooms;
- 4 bedrooms are furnished with beds or desks;
- Newly finished laminate floor and wall painting;
- Each unit has its own washer/dryer hook-up;
- Central HVAC and forced air heating;
- Large back yard full of fruit trees;
- Adequate parking space: 2 in front, 2 in garage, and 3 in backyard;
- Rent: $5200 for the whole house;
Or if to rent separately, $3200 for 3-bed unit (up to 5 people); $2200 for 2-bed unit (up to 4 people);
- Utilities: on tenants.
Prerequisite:
- Credit score of 700 or above
For serious inquiries only, text 614-five99-3.Seven.6.Nine

